# Copy to .env.local
#
# Leave this file absent entirely and the dashboard reads the local JSON
# snapshot in public/data/, which is what `edgelord sync` writes. That is the
# intended development mode -- no Firebase project required.
#
# To read from Firestore instead, paste the *contents* of your service account
# JSON key on one line:
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT={"type":"service_account","project_id":"...", ...}
